{"ID":"20250918112034-ixktclc","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250918112034-ixktclc","title":"UPL5-11——禁用未使用的脚本和对象","type":"doc","updated":"20251104172919"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918115927-blxxe68","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250918115927-blxxe68","updated":"20250918120437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20250918120014-poys6gx","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250918120014-poys6gx","updated":"20250918120437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"OnBecameVisible() { }\t\t\t\t\t\t// 当依附对象存在Renderer且对任一摄像机（主摄像机、UI摄像机、小地图摄像机、Scene 视图摄像机等）可见时调用\nOnBecameInvisible() { }\t\t\t\t\t\t// 当依附对象存在Renderer且对任何摄像机（主摄像机、UI摄像机、小地图摄像机、Scene 视图摄像机等）都不可见时调用\nGeometryUtility.CalculateFrustumPlanes()\t// 获取摄像机视锥体六个平面\nGeometryUtility.TestPlanesAABB()\t\t\t// 判断一个AABB包围盒是否与一组平面（如视锥体）相交或包含\nrenderer.bounds\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 获取渲染器的包围盒\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250918112034-7yqxyc1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250918112034-7yqxyc1","updated":"20251104172919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禁用未使用的脚本和对象"}]},{"ID":"20250918112049-ym9zcto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112049-ym9zcto","updated":"20250918112135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所谓的禁用未使用的脚本和对象，是指在 特定游戏类型中 对那些不在玩家视野内，或者离玩家太远的游戏对象，采用不处理他们的优化方案，达到节约性能的目的\n尤其是项目内容庞大，场景复杂或者设备性能有限的情况下，这种优化手段非常实用"}]},{"ID":"20250918112107-3pn86w6","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250918112107-3pn86w6","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250918112107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250918112107-5cwtlo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112107-5cwtlo0","updated":"20250918112107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意：这种优化方案，只适用于那些禁用对象不会对游戏过程产生明显影响的游戏"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918112151-yiebfgs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250918112151-yiebfgs","updated":"20251104172919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 的视锥剔除和遮挡剔除"}]},{"ID":"20250918112202-v2ekwx9","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250918112202-v2ekwx9","updated":"20251104172919"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918112207-y0nugfh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918112207-y0nugfh","updated":"20250918112207"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918112207-vpmi4yp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112207-vpmi4yp","updated":"20250918112207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"视锥剔除："}]},{"ID":"20250918112209-si6d6de","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112209-si6d6de","updated":"20250918112209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自动剔除摄像机视野之外的对象\n只影响渲染系统，不会绘制被剔除的对象"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918112208-9kbwykn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918112208-9kbwykn","updated":"20251104172919"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918112208-6atdqge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112208-6atdqge","updated":"20250918112208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遮挡剔除："}]},{"ID":"20250918112211-hkhfsjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112211-hkhfsjg","updated":"20250918112211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"剔除虽然在摄像机视野内、但被其他物体挡住的对象\n同样是只影响渲染系统，防止浪费 GPU 绘制不可见的物体"}]},{"ID":"20251104172900-iap0aub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251104172900-iap0aub","updated":"20251104172919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于遮挡剔除，详细可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251104172753-5vtxovd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"UPL9-4——遮挡剔除"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918112205-pdobp1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112205-pdobp1y","updated":"20250918112227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也就是说，Unity 中的视锥剔除和遮挡剔除其实只会优化 GPU 渲染层面的性能\n对象身上依附的各种组件，还是会照常执行，并不能起到禁用未使用的脚本和对象 优化 CPU 性能的目的"}]},{"ID":"20250918112242-3efgyw0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"alias":"OnBecameInvisible()","id":"20250918112242-3efgyw0","name":"OnBecameVisible()","updated":"20250918113046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"OnBecameVisible 和 OnBecameInvisible 函数"}]},{"ID":"20250918112253-kpuafzu","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250918112253-kpuafzu","updated":"20250918112307"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918112307-g41xtw6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918112307-g41xtw6","updated":"20250918112307"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918112307-ug3ko9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112307-ug3ko9z","updated":"20250918112405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"OnBecameVisible()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：在渲染器（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Renderer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​）对 任一摄像机（主摄像机、UI摄像机、小地图摄像机、Scene 视图摄像机等） 可见时调用"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918112308-oevyf9e","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918112308-oevyf9e","updated":"20250918112308"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918112308-1atxxow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112308-1atxxow","updated":"20250918112412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"OnBecameInvisible()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：在渲染器（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Renderer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​）对 任何摄像机（主摄像机、UI摄像机、小地图摄像机、Scene 视图摄像机等） 都不可见时调用"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918112622-hjy3j1l","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250918112622-hjy3j1l","updated":"20250918113046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"private void OnBecameVisible()\n{\n    Debug.Log(\"GameObject OnBecameVisible\");\n}\n\nprivate void OnBecameInvisible()\n{\n    Debug.Log(\"GameObject OnBecameInvisible\");\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250918112253-zj77bfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112253-zj77bfb","updated":"20250918112257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意："}]},{"ID":"20250918112257-dn2gxaa","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918112257-dn2gxaa","updated":"20250918112302"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918112257-ksmetu3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918112257-ksmetu3","updated":"20250918112257"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918112257-ckkq53s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112257-ckkq53s","updated":"20250918112257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Scene 视图摄像机也会导致调用该函数"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918112257-0qq4x9z","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918112257-0qq4x9z","updated":"20250918112302"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918112257-1xhwivl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112257-1xhwivl","updated":"20250918112302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所依附的对象上必须有 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Renderer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 渲染器相关组件"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918112257-mjd7vca","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250918112257-mjd7vca","updated":"20250918112257"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918112257-a0uh0p4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112257-a0uh0p4","updated":"20250918112257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对象失活后，由于渲染器也会失活，这两个函数不再响应"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918112257-mfs3ej7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250918112257-mfs3ej7","updated":"20250918112257"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918112257-b331nu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112257-b331nu6","updated":"20250918112257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即使这两个函数所在的组件失活，只要渲染器存在，就会响应"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918112425-vqghdxq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250918112425-vqghdxq","updated":"20250918115911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用距离禁用对象"}]},{"ID":"20250918112433-wdf5tla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918112433-wdf5tla","updated":"20250918112433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过判断需要禁用的对象和玩家或摄像机距离过远时主动禁用对象\n比如我们通过怪物、子弹等等管理器，不停判断他们和主要目标的距离\n当超过需求值时主动禁用对象"}]},{"ID":"20250918113443-irgxib0","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250918113443-irgxib0","updated":"20250918113454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"if (Vector3.Distance(this.transform.position, otherTrans.position) \u003e= 50f)\n{\n    // 禁用相关的逻辑\n    // 比如失活组件、对象失活、放入缓存池等等 \n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250918113422-6igwdx2","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250918113422-6igwdx2","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250918115911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250918113436-r9jsjw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918113436-r9jsjw7","updated":"20250918115911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意：在进行距离判断时，可以采用距离的平方（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-font-background6);"},"TextMarkType":"code block-ref text","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230711173904-4j4ji2b","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Vector3.sqrMagnitude"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-font-background6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​）进行比较，这样可以减少开方的消耗"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918113345-f43rclq","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250918113345-f43rclq","updated":"20250918113732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"if ((this.transform.position - otherTrans.position).sqrMagnitude \u003e= 2500)\n{\n    // 禁用相关的逻辑\n    // 比如失活组件、对象失活、放入缓存池等等 \n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250918112515-229743f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"alias":"GeometryUtility.CalculateFrustumPlanes(),renderer.bounds","id":"20250918112515-229743f","name":"GeometryUtility.TestPlanesAABB()","updated":"20250918120344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主动判断视锥范围"}]},{"ID":"20250918113520-3ieggoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918113520-3ieggoo","updated":"20250918113544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 中提供了一个几何工具类，其中有两个重要方法："}]},{"ID":"20250918113546-9tnu19x","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918113546-9tnu19x","updated":"20250918113549"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918113549-mgl3ctc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918113549-mgl3ctc","updated":"20250918113549"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918113549-9l0tu68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918113549-9l0tu68","updated":"20250918113553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"GeometryUtility.TestPlanesAABB"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250918113550-73cg6xh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918113550-73cg6xh","updated":"20250918113550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用于判断一个AABB包围盒是否与一组平面（如视锥体）相交或包含"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918113549-thk0d2n","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918113549-thk0d2n","updated":"20250918113549"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918113549-lnota2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918113549-lnota2n","updated":"20250918113555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"GeometryUtility.CalculateFrustumPlanes"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250918113558-z6v5byw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918113558-z6v5byw","updated":"20250918113558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用于获取摄像机视锥体六个平面"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918120312-49i9bb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918120312-49i9bb0","updated":"20250918120344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而通过渲染器可以得到该对象的包围盒："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"renderer.bounds"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250918113539-foutbdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918113539-foutbdt","updated":"20250918113539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常用于："}]},{"ID":"20250918113533-yz73po4","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918113533-yz73po4","updated":"20250918113533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918113533-mz7uyzu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918113533-mz7uyzu","updated":"20250918113533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918113533-mufsgg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918113533-mufsgg1","updated":"20250918113533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自定义检测"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918113533-brt65h0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918113533-brt65h0","updated":"20250918113533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918113533-ex5me1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918113533-ex5me1c","updated":"20250918113533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自定义剔除"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918113533-j8nb5c1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250918113533-j8nb5c1","updated":"20250918113533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918113533-6mgqd61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918113533-6mgqd61","updated":"20250918113533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"镜头内检测"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918113533-6cv5anc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250918113533-6cv5anc","updated":"20250918113533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918113533-fgd2bv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918113533-fgd2bv9","updated":"20250918113533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优化游戏对象激活与逻辑执行"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918113530-8t6wovr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918113530-8t6wovr","updated":"20250918113530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250918114206-gle85yk","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250918114206-gle85yk","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250918114209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250918114209-zhtyuhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918114209-zhtyuhd","updated":"20250918114209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意：场景中少量对象，可以放心使用该方法判断，若场景中对象过多，因采用分帧处理等等优化手段降低开销"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918113633-dxvhavq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918113633-dxvhavq","updated":"20250918113635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法："}]},{"ID":"20250918113637-1yqsfni","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250918113637-1yqsfni","updated":"20250918114355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"private Plane[] _planes;\nprivate Renderer _renderer;\n\nprivate void Start()\n{\n    // 1. 获取摄像机视锥体平面\n    _planes = GeometryUtility.CalculateFrustumPlanes(Camera.main);\n    _renderer = GetComponent\u003cRenderer\u003e();\n}\n\nprivate void Update()\n{\n    // 2. 利用摄像机视锥体平面和对象的包围盒进行相交判断\n    if (GeometryUtility.TestPlanesAABB(_planes, _renderer.bounds))\n    {\n        Debug.Log(\"GameObject 在Main摄像机视锥内\");\n    }\n    else\n    {\n        Debug.Log(\"GameObject 在Main摄像机视锥外\");\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250918114151-9nnmtsu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918114151-9nnmtsu","updated":"20250918114204"}},{"ID":"20250918114201-nq3y1iw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918114201-nq3y1iw","updated":"20250918114201"}}]}